  <file id="dialogs\randomevents\xpbl\dnd_bartender.txt" original="dialogs\randomevents\xpbl\dnd_bartender.txt">
    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I mix stuff and ya drop it in. Nice and simple.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a3" name="=&gt;a3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Let's see what you've been mixing for tonight. ::Barter.:: &lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a4" name="=&gt;a4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Tell me more about this place.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Drag 'n' Drop, the name pretty much tells it all. This place used to be a mobile naval storage platform. Owned by one of 'em old corporations while they were messin' around here. It can't move on it's own, but rather, it's gotta be towed around by a big ol' ship. Don't ask me why it was made that way cause it makes no sense to me either, aight? ::She shrugs.:: Luckily though, it does have a workin' anchor, otherwise it would've been a huge piece of junk. ::Her attention for a moment is occupied by ever-growing pile of dirty glass shots. She grabs one of them and starts cleaning it up.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Anyways, it was abandoned quite a while ago, and my lil' crew and I were the first ones to find it. Figured we could make use out of it, so we turned it into a club as ya can see. Lots of stuff happened since now and then, and nowadays, we rely on friends of ours to drag us around when we make a good deal with 'em. Recent times didn't treat us well at all, when it comes to keepin' our platform in one piece. Ah well, guess all our savings will have to go into renovations. Cost of runnin' any business, am I right? ::She sighs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a7" name="=&gt;a7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>How's the party going?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>All's good, we be mixin' and chillin'.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Gotta come up with some strong mixes tonight.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Eyes sharp; my mixes -sharper still.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Pirates... our new company here... To be honest, I've never expected this day would come. Take what you want from that. ::She laughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Lets just say... I do my job, and they're payin' pretty damn well. Yeah, that's about it.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q13" name="=&gt;q13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>It's the special time of the year! Beer is back on the menu! ::She laughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q14" name="=&gt;q14">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">28</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>We've seen better nights. This time though, people ain't droppin' in.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a15" name="=&gt;a15">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">30</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Any rumors around this place?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q16" name="=&gt;q16">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">32</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q17" name="=&gt;q17">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">34</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Pirates are all over the waters here. They're scarin' off my customers. Not cool.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q18" name="=&gt;q18">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">36</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>The other day, some workers were celebratin' here the death of someone called: "Balor". I wouldn't drop in for a thing like that. Imagine someone did that to you, you know?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q19" name="=&gt;q19">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">38</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Folks are very happy about the Faceless leavin' the place. They were never a problem for me so I don't know. I guess people will stop talkin' about them now. The topic was so annoyin'.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q20" name="=&gt;q20">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">40</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Lots of people are mumblin' about them Faceless. It's getting annoyin' at this point.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q21" name="=&gt;q21">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">42</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>There is a big openin' of sorts in the waterways, west of the Rig, I think. People are sayin' it's got a bad omen to it. Bunch of fellas went in there and never came back.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q22" name="=&gt;q22">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">44</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Some fellas are talkin' about a certain someone chillin' alone on a nice big ol' ship near the Core City. They are callin' him some really bad names though. Like, a fat rat or somethin'. Not sure why they're hatin'.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q23" name="=&gt;q23">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">46</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Not really a rumor per say, but I kinda miss that one guy which dropped in here once. He was all sorts of strange but he knew his way with the mixes and stuff. The two of us could've made a huge business if he was to stay here with us. ::She licks her lips.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q24" name="=&gt;q24">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">48</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>One time, an old guy came in here makin' some weird noises and stuff. He freaked me out a little, cuz' he was all shakin' and talkin' to himself. All I could hear from him was some talk about trophies and an eater or somethin'. I don't know. ::She shrugs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q25" name="=&gt;q25">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">50</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Some Black Eels were all mad about somethin'. They were like: "Oh no what do we do without him? ::She makes a worried ironic face.:: There's no one left to run the Junkyard now." ::She sighs.:: Who cares, really.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q26" name="=&gt;q26">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">52</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Workers from Foundry are all very excited all of a sudden. They are sayin' that the mine has reopened. And all I'm thinkin' about is like, someone's gotta deliver the water, you know. Feed those who provide for the rest of us. ::She laughs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q27" name="=&gt;q27">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">54</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Waterways are pretty messy these days. Fellas are talkin' about it all the time. I'm afraid I'll lose a bunch of customers. Oh well... ::She shakes her head.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a28" name="=&gt;a28">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">56</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'll think about it. ::Leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q29" name="=&gt;q29">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">58</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>People are down for some droppin' after workin' hard all day. Lemme tell ya, my mixes tonight, gonna rail up some guts for sure.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q30" name="=&gt;q30">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">60</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>It's an all-in party tonight. Down to risk it up with some of my mixes? &lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q31" name="=&gt;q31">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">62</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>With all the things goin' around this... this is the natural outcome of it all I suppose. ::She rolls her eyes.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q32" name="=&gt;q32">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">64</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Armed to the teeth, they kinda make ya feel safe, ya know? ::She looks at the cash register. It is quite obvious to you that she's not happy.:: We should always remember that it could be much worse than that. ::She nods.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q33" name="=&gt;q33">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">66</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q34" name="=&gt;q34">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">68</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Yo, yo, yo! Welcome to the Waterbrew fest! This week, we're mixing it up with some special beers comin' from best brewers around the waterways! ::She invites you to try her drinks.:: &lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q35" name="=&gt;q35">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">70</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a36" name="=&gt;a36">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">72</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Alright show me what you have. ::Barter.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a37" name="=&gt;a37">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">74</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Quite an odd name for a festival, wouldn't you say?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q38" name="=&gt;q38">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">76</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Ayy, what do ya mean? ::She looks startled.:: It's pretty simple and straight to the point, no?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a39" name="=&gt;a39">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">78</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>It just leaves a bad first impression. You need something much more... attractive.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q40" name="=&gt;q40">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">80</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::She nods to herself a couple of times and leans over closer to you.:: I get it, I get it... ::She whispers.:: Don't be loud about it, okay? Tell me a new name and I'll fix it right up.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a41" name="=&gt;a41">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">82</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I don't know, leave the brew part and get rid of the water stuff. Something like that.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q42" name="=&gt;q42">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">84</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::She laughs and whispers back to you.:: Okay, okaaay. ::She nods with a wide grin on her face as steps back away.:: I like it.

Thanks for the suggestion. It'll take me a couple of hours to do it. Don't forget to come back and check it out, okay?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a43" name="=&gt;a43">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">86</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>You are welcome. Now, let me buy a drink. ::Barter.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a44" name="=&gt;a44">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">88</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'm here to help. ::Nod and leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a45" name="=&gt;a45">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">90</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Hardcore Drop. What could top off the already strong stuff - find out now!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a46" name="=&gt;a46">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">92</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>One Off Week. Might make the event stand out a bit more in people's minds.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a47" name="=&gt;a47">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">94</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>No Cocktails. A twist to the usual stuff.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a48" name="=&gt;a48">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">96</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I could come up with many naughty jokes about it. You don't want people to view this event as a comedic disaster.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a49" name="=&gt;a49">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">98</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Despite water being one of the ingredients, it doesn't bode well for the drinks to boast about it. Makes them look really, how should I say... weak and just... bad.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a50" name="=&gt;a50">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">100</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q51" name="=&gt;q51">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">102</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Heya, I've changed the name of the festival as ya suggested. Check out the menu and let me know if ya like it. ::She laughs as she points to the menu at her side.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q52" name="=&gt;q52">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">104</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
